"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">46</div><h1>2격의 격식 표현과 동격</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Genitiv in der Schriftsprache und Apposition</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 46의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>C1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 · 보강 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">2격을 받는 동사와 형용사를 알아보고 2격을 맞춰 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">격식 있는 2격 전치사의 뜻을 구별해요 — ungeachtet · mangels · unweit · um … willen</div><div class=\"x-goal\">meines Erachtens · eines Tages 같은 2격의 굳은 표현을 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">동격을 앞 명사와 같은 격으로 덧붙여요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"a775076669\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Diese Frage bedarf <span class=\"qblank\"></span> genauen Prüfung.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) einem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) ein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) eine</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) einer</button></div><div class=\"qe\">bedürfen은 2격을 받아요. die Prüfung → einer genauen Prüfung.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"68c8bda5dd\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Ich bin mir <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Problems bewusst.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) des</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) das</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich einer Sache bewusst sein — 2격을 받아요. das Problem → des Problems.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ac9406cce3\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Erachtens kostet der Umbau zu viel.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Meiner</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Meines</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Meinen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Meinem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">meines Erachtens = 내 생각에는. 2격의 굳은 표현이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ac0c55a98f\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Die Jugendherberge befindet sich unweit <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) dem Marktplatz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) des Marktplatzes</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) der Marktplatz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) den Marktplatz</button></div><div class=\"qe\">unweit는 2격 전치사예요 — '~에서 멀지 않은 곳에'.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d7f683c2c2\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Wir haben mit Frau Hoffmann, <span class=\"qblank\"></span>, gesprochen.</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) den neuen Schulleiterin</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) der neuen Schulleiterin</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) der neue Schulleiterin</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) die neue Schulleiterin</button></div><div class=\"qe\">동격은 앞 명사와 같은 격이에요. mit + 3격 → der neuen Schulleiterin.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e1fb98537a\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Tages möchte ich ein eigenes Café eröffnen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) Ein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Eines</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Einen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Einem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">eines Tages = 언젠가. 전치사 없이 2격만으로 때를 나타내는 굳은 표현이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"09c00d8245\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;des&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Jedes Jahr gedenkt das Dorf <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(2격 관사)</span> Gründers der Schule.</div><div class=\"qko\">해마다 마을은 학교를 세운 분을 기려요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Jedes Jahr gedenkt das Dorf <b>des</b> Gründers der Schule.</div>gedenken은 2격을 받아요. der Gründer → des Gründers.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ebb0fc0d06\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;er&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Das alte Kino erfreut sich wachsend<input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(2격 여성 · 관사 없음)</span> Beliebtheit.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 오래된 영화관은 갈수록 인기를 얻고 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das alte Kino erfreut sich wachsend<b>er</b> Beliebtheit.</div>sich erfreuen은 2격을 받아요. 관사가 없으니 형용사 어미 -er가 2격을 보여 줘요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"27e50e5de8\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mir&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Ich bin <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(재귀대명사)</span> der Schwierigkeiten bewusst.</div><div class=\"qko\">저는 그 어려움을 잘 알고 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich bin <b>mir</b> der Schwierigkeiten bewusst.</div>sich bewusst sein의 sich는 3격이에요 → ich bin mir.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6d55d9bea8\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;des&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Der Kassierer wird <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(2격 관사)</span> Diebstahls verdächtigt.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 계산원은 절도 혐의를 받고 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Kassierer wird <b>des</b> Diebstahls verdächtigt.</div>jemanden einer Sache verdächtigen — 사람은 4격, 일은 2격이에요. 수동문에서도 2격은 그대로예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"35fd69545d\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Meines&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(내가 알기로)</span> Wissens fährt am Sonntag kein Bus.</div><div class=\"qko\">내가 알기로 일요일에는 버스가 다니지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Meines</b> Wissens fährt am Sonntag kein Bus.</div>meines Wissens = 내가 알기로는. 첫 자리를 차지해서 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6b0c42683e\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;willen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Um des lieben Friedens <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> schwieg er.</div><div class=\"qko\">괜한 다툼을 피하려고 그는 입을 다물었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Um des lieben Friedens <b>willen</b> schwieg er.</div>um + 2격 + willen = ~을 위해서. 2격 명사를 가운데에 끼워요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ad0f65636f\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;er&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Die Klage wurde mangels ausreichend<input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(2격 복수 · 관사 없음)</span> Beweise abgewiesen.</div><div class=\"qko\">증거가 충분하지 않아서 그 소송은 기각됐어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Klage wurde mangels ausreichend<b>er</b> Beweise abgewiesen.</div>mangels는 2격 전치사예요. 관사가 없으니 형용사 어미 -er가 2격을 보여 줘요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"177ff4d10b\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;er&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Das ist ein Bild von Clara, mein<input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(3격 여성)</span> ältesten Freundin.</div><div class=\"qko\">이건 가장 오랜 친구인 클라라의 사진이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das ist ein Bild von Clara, mein<b>er</b> ältesten Freundin.</div>동격은 앞 명사와 같은 격이에요. von + 3격 → meiner ältesten Freundin.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5a9ea2d2c0\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Meines Erachtens brauchen wir einen neuen Plan&quot;,&quot;Wir brauchen meines Erachtens einen neuen Plan&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">제 생각에는 새 계획이 필요해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Erachtens</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">einen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Plan</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">brauchen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Meines</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">neuen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">wir</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Meines Erachtens brauchen wir einen neuen Plan.</b></div>meines Erachtens가 첫 자리에 오면 바로 뒤에 동사 brauchen이 와요. nach는 붙이지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"35f5014a3f\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Letzten Endes muss jeder selbst entscheiden&quot;,&quot;Jeder muss letzten Endes selbst entscheiden&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">결국은 저마다 스스로 정해야 해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">selbst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">muss</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">jeder</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">entscheiden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Letzten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Endes</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Letzten Endes muss jeder selbst entscheiden.</b></div>letzten Endes = 결국. 2격의 굳은 표현이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"5578cbbefe\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> 'Das Gerät braucht regelmäßige Pflege.'와 뜻이 같은 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Das Gerät bedient sich regelmäßiger Pflege.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) Das Gerät bedarf regelmäßige Pflege.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) Das Gerät bedarf regelmäßiger Pflege.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Das Gerät gedenkt regelmäßiger Pflege.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">brauchen + 4격 = bedürfen + 2격. 관사 없는 2격 여성은 형용사 어미 -er예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8ef750f20c\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Die Zeitung beschreibt ihn als <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) einen ehrlichen Politiker</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) einem ehrlichen Politiker</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) ein ehrlicher Politiker</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) eines ehrlichen Politikers</button></div><div class=\"qe\">als + 명사는 가리키는 말과 같은 격이에요. ihn이 4격이라서 einen ehrlichen Politiker예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7d5ebe8b63\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> der vielen Proteste wurde das Gesetz beschlossen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Ungeachtet</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) Mangels</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Kraft</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Zugunsten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">ungeachtet + 2격 = ~에도 불구하고. trotz의 격식 있는 말이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e2b7e0497c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Stimme&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Bei der Abstimmung haben sich drei Mitglieder der <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(명사)</span> enthalten.</div><div class=\"qko\">표결에서 회원 세 명이 기권했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Bei der Abstimmung haben sich drei Mitglieder der <b>Stimme</b> enthalten.</div>sich der Stimme enthalten = 기권하다. sich enthalten은 2격을 받아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6e7b664d29\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bedarf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Unser Vorhaben braucht die Unterstützung aller.<br>→ Unser Vorhaben <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(2격을 받는 동사)</span> der Unterstützung aller.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 계획은 모두의 지원이 필요해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Unser Vorhaben braucht die Unterstützung aller.<br>→ Unser Vorhaben <b>bedarf</b> der Unterstützung aller.</div>brauchen + 4격 → bedürfen + 2격. bedürfen은 dürfen처럼 변해요 — er bedarf.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"efaf040689\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Amtes&quot;,&quot;Amts&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Die Direktorin wurde wegen des Skandals ihres <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(명사 · 2격)</span> enthoben.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 관장은 그 일로 자리에서 물러나게 됐어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Direktorin wurde wegen des Skandals ihres <b>Amtes</b> enthoben.</div>jemanden seines Amtes entheben = 직에서 물러나게 하다. das Amt → des Amtes.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9dc0818bb8\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;es&quot;],[&quot;en&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Das ist das Haus meines Onkels, ein<input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(2격 남성)</span> bekannt<input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(형용사 어미)</span> Architekten.</div><div class=\"qko\">이건 이름난 건축가인 삼촌의 집이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das ist das Haus meines Onkels, ein<b>es</b> bekannt<b>en</b> Architekten.</div>앞 명사 meines Onkels가 2격이니 동격도 2격이에요 → eines bekannten Architekten.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ac0803e84d\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sie ist sich ihrer Sache ganz sicher&quot;,&quot;Ihrer Sache ist sie sich ganz sicher&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 자기 생각이 맞다고 굳게 믿어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ihrer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Sache</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">sicher</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">ganz</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">sich</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sie ist sich ihrer Sache ganz sicher.</b></div>sich einer Sache sicher sein — 2격 ihrer Sache가 형용사 sicher 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"51e3f254b2\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Meines Erachtens nach ist das Angebot fair.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) Der Vollständigkeit halber nenne ich auch die Nachteile.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Binnen eines Monats muss die Rechnung bezahlt sein.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Kraft ihres Amtes kann die Präsidentin das Gesetz stoppen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">meines Erachtens에는 nach를 붙이지 않아요. nach는 3격과 써요 — meiner Meinung nach.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5436c772fd\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> 'Die Firma bediente sich eines Tricks.'에서 bediente sich의 뜻은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) 도와줬어요</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) 수단으로 썼어요</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) 삼갔어요</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) 자랑했어요</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich einer Sache bedienen = ~을 수단으로 쓰다. 쉬운 말로는 Die Firma benutzte einen Trick이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"a41f06fbea\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ein&quot;],[&quot;der&quot;],[&quot;Ungeachtet&quot;,&quot;Trotz&quot;],[&quot;der&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> Der Bürgermeister, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(관사 · 1격)</span> erfahrener Politiker, ist sich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(관사 · 2격)</span> Lage bewusst. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(~에도 불구하고)</span> aller Kritik will er im Amt bleiben. Die Entscheidung bedarf jedoch <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(관사 · 2격)</span> Genehmigung des Stadtrats.</div><div class=\"qko\">경험 많은 정치인인 시장은 상황을 잘 알고 있어요. 온갖 비판에도 그는 자리를 지키려고 해요. 하지만 그 결정은 시의회의 승인이 필요해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Bürgermeister, <b>ein</b> erfahrener Politiker, ist sich <b>der</b> Lage bewusst. <b>Ungeachtet</b> aller Kritik will er im Amt bleiben. Die Entscheidung bedarf jedoch <b>der</b> Genehmigung des Stadtrats.</div>동격은 주어와 같은 1격 → ein erfahrener Politiker.<br>sich bewusst sein · bedürfen은 2격 → der Lage · der Genehmigung. ungeachtet도 2격을 받아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"33b70c4912\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;dem&quot;],[&quot;Leiter&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Ich habe mit Professor Lange gesprochen. Er ist der Leiter des Instituts.<br>→ Ich habe mit Professor Lange, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(관사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(명사)</span> des Instituts, gesprochen.</div><div class=\"qko\">연구소장인 랑게 교수와 이야기했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe mit Professor Lange gesprochen. Er ist der Leiter des Instituts.<br>→ Ich habe mit Professor Lange, <b>dem</b> <b>Leiter</b> des Instituts, gesprochen.</div>두 문장을 동격으로 이었어요. mit + 3격이라서 동격도 3격 dem Leiter예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e1b0756a3c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mächtig&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> Sie spricht sehr gut Französisch.<br>→ Sie ist des Französischen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(형용사)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 프랑스어를 할 줄 알아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Sie spricht sehr gut Französisch.<br>→ Sie ist des Französischen <b>mächtig</b>.</div>einer Sache mächtig sein = ~을 다룰 줄 알다. 언어 이름은 2격 des Französischen으로 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4e6d7e3a7a\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Zugunsten ihrer Kinder verzichtete sie auf eine eigene Karriere&quot;,&quot;Sie verzichtete zugunsten ihrer Kinder auf eine eigene Karriere&quot;,&quot;Auf eine eigene Karriere verzichtete sie zugunsten ihrer Kinder&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 아이들을 위해 자기 경력을 내려놓았어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">auf</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Zugunsten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ihrer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">eine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">verzichtete</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">eigene</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Karriere</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">Kinder</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Zugunsten ihrer Kinder verzichtete sie auf eine eigene Karriere.</b></div>zugunsten + 2격 = ~을 위해. 전치사 목적어 auf eine eigene Karriere는 가운데 자리의 뒤쪽에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge plus-badge\">보강</span><span class=\"sub-title\">보강 문제 · 문장을 바꿔 쓰고, 틀린 단어를 찾아요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"bdd29fd08e\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Der Plan bedarf einer sorgfältigen Überarbeitung.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> brauchen을 bedürfen으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Der Plan braucht eine sorgfältige Überarbeitung.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 31\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Der Plan bedarf einer sorgfältigen Überarbeitung.</b></div>bedürfen은 2격을 받아요. eine sorgfältige Überarbeitung → einer sorgfältigen Überarbeitung.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"79972b097c\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich besuche Herrn Wagner, meinen früheren Lehrer.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">32.</strong> 두 문장을 동격으로 이어 한 문장으로 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Ich besuche Herrn Wagner. Er ist mein früherer Lehrer.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect